&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Cloud Platform Engineer on the Runway team, you&#39;ll help design, build, and maintain the infrastructure and developer tooling that powers our engineering organization. You&#39;ll advance our Kubernetes-based platform, mature our GitOps practices, and expand infrastructure as code adoption across the business. This hands-on role brings together infrastructure, automation, and developer experience, helping application teams deploy and operate their services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Operate and improve production Kubernetes clusters across cloud environments, managing upgrades, scaling, and reliability throughout the cluster lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Own and extend Argo CD-based GitOps workflows, maintaining ApplicationSets, managing sync policies, and enforcing deployment standards across environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Write, review, and maintain reusable Terraform modules, with clear practices for state management and drift detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Monitor platform health, respond to incidents, conduct post-mortems, and improve availability, performance, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Collaborate with application teams to onboard services, and create documentation, runbooks, and self-service tooling that improves developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Implement role-based access control, network policies, and secrets management to meet infrastructure security and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Integrate platform capabilities with continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD) pipelines to support end-to-end delivery workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience operating Kubernetes in production and working with at least one major cloud provider: Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, or Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience with Argo CD or comparable GitOps tooling, such as Flux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Terraform for cloud infrastructure provisioning, including remote state, workspaces, and module design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Ability to write scripts and automation in Python, Bash, or Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Helm for Kubernetes package management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Understanding of networking fundamentals, including the Domain Name System (DNS), load balancing, ingress, and service mesh concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, with the ability to document systems and collaborate across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Optional: experience with managed, multi-cluster, or multi-region Kubernetes, service meshes, policy as code, observability, or Kubernetes-native infrastructure as code; open source or platform tooling contributions; or relevant certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Runway team builds and maintains infrastructure and developer tooling for GitLab&#39;s engineering organization. Its work centers on a Kubernetes-based platform, GitOps delivery practices, and infrastructure as code. The team collaborates with application teams to onboard services and improve developer productivity through documentation, runbooks, and self-service tooling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
